1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Illuru, Illuru, were you playing with those humans again?

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,000
I love humans very much, they're so nice!

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:17,000
I see. Then perhaps it is time we consider coexisting with these mortal beings.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Bad news! The humans are attacking the Dragon Village!

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,000
This always happens when we choose to stay silent.

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,000
Damn humans, they will pay!

7
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Weird's mommy and daddy!

8
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:33,000
I'm sorry, my dear.

9
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Does this mean I can't play with the humans anymore?

10
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Of course it does! Those humans are the ones who took your parents away from you!

11
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:47,000
They will forever be our enemy. We will never come to an understanding.

12
00:02:16,967 --> 00:02:25,027
Oh, good. Everyone's asleep.

13
00:02:27,527 --> 00:02:31,667
Seeing one of those up close for the first time is traumatic enough without it being mine.

14
00:02:34,967 --> 00:02:37,907
Hey! There you are, Miss Kobayashi! Welcome home!

15
00:02:38,927 --> 00:02:41,527
Will you please let me know next time you're going to be late?

16
00:02:41,687 --> 00:02:43,467
Oh, yeah. I'm sorry.

17
00:02:43,787 --> 00:02:46,667
Your face is flushed and sweaty. Are you feeling okay?

18
00:02:46,967 --> 00:02:47,407
Huh?

19
00:02:48,707 --> 00:02:50,247
Maybe you're catching a cold.

20
00:02:50,507 --> 00:02:52,407
Yes! Don't touch me! I'm fine!

21
00:02:53,487 --> 00:02:57,627
What the hell? Why do I start to sweat and almost pass out whenever I look at her?

22
00:02:57,947 --> 00:03:00,747
Is it lust? Am I lusting now? After Toru?

23
00:03:01,607 --> 00:03:03,147
Go put your clothes on, please.

24
00:03:03,787 --> 00:03:04,187
Okay.

25
00:03:07,607 --> 00:03:10,547
Kobayashi, you can't hide anymore now that you're a man.

26
00:03:10,787 --> 00:03:12,987
You'll show everyone your true colors in no time.

27
00:03:12,987 --> 00:03:17,307
But I get to see first. Show me how shallow humans are.

28
00:03:17,527 --> 00:03:19,207
That's totally what this is about.

29
00:03:20,067 --> 00:03:24,607
I bet Alulu turned me into a dude so that I would unwittingly display the worst of humanity.

30
00:03:25,347 --> 00:03:26,707
I just hope it's over soon.

31
00:03:26,707 --> 00:03:33,047
Although, I have no idea what she's trying to get out of me.

32
00:03:33,047 --> 00:03:36,927
I definitely need to keep a clear head as a dude.

33
00:03:37,447 --> 00:03:37,767
Hmm.

34
00:03:37,767 --> 00:03:49,707
Hey! What are you doing here?

35
00:03:51,507 --> 00:03:53,627
I'm snuggling. Good morning.

36
00:03:54,107 --> 00:03:54,727
But why?

37
00:03:55,087 --> 00:03:57,347
I was worried you'd be cold this morning.

38
00:03:57,347 --> 00:04:00,327
Okay! I'm warm! I'm warm and awake!

39
00:04:00,827 --> 00:04:02,027
Time to start the day!

40
00:04:02,027 --> 00:04:09,267
I have no idea how this thing works or when it might activate.

41
00:04:09,787 --> 00:04:12,587
Which is why I'll need to keep my distance from the others.

42
00:04:13,167 --> 00:04:15,607
I wonder if this is something Toru could fix.

43
00:04:15,807 --> 00:04:17,667
What? This Kobayashi's a man?

44
00:04:17,947 --> 00:04:19,327
What are we waiting for?

45
00:04:19,607 --> 00:04:21,327
Let's work on preserving our species!

46
00:04:22,627 --> 00:04:23,707
Maybe I'll wait.

47
00:04:24,047 --> 00:04:26,207
Okay, it's time to ride the canoe to adventure.

48
00:04:26,207 --> 00:04:27,187
What are you watching, Kana?

49
00:04:27,307 --> 00:04:28,887
It's called clinky-clang.

50
00:04:28,887 --> 00:04:32,927
Is everybody ready?

51
00:04:33,347 --> 00:04:34,427
Let's go!

52
00:04:34,947 --> 00:04:35,267
Go!

53
00:04:35,967 --> 00:04:38,207
Now let's get paddling!

54
00:04:40,547 --> 00:04:41,547
Oh, no!

55
00:04:41,867 --> 00:04:43,487
There's a waterfall up ahead!

56
00:04:46,527 --> 00:04:48,567
Total disregard for personal space

57
00:04:48,567 --> 00:04:50,027
is normal between female friends.

58
00:04:50,207 --> 00:04:50,807
It's what we do.

59
00:04:50,987 --> 00:04:51,727
I can handle it.

60
00:04:51,727 --> 00:04:54,627
I will not allow this penis to define my instincts.

61
00:04:55,327 --> 00:04:56,087
Save me!

62
00:04:56,727 --> 00:04:58,307
Do not hug me for no reason!

63
00:04:58,307 --> 00:04:59,347
Kobayashi!

64
00:04:59,847 --> 00:05:00,207
Get up!

65
00:05:00,387 --> 00:05:01,127
Please get up!

66
00:05:01,367 --> 00:05:02,167
Ms. Kobayashi!

67
00:05:02,767 --> 00:05:04,927
What did I tell you about random hug attacks?

68
00:05:05,227 --> 00:05:05,747
Hi!

69
00:05:06,027 --> 00:05:06,867
Get out!

70
00:05:06,867 --> 00:05:07,347
Get out!

71
00:05:11,547 --> 00:05:15,567
That was so close.

72
00:05:15,727 --> 00:05:17,287
I've forgotten how clingy she is.

73
00:05:19,947 --> 00:05:20,987
Thank goodness.

74
00:05:21,307 --> 00:05:22,567
It's finally gone smaller.

75
00:05:22,567 --> 00:05:27,487
I figured Elulu's powers had been weakened during her battle with Toru.

76
00:05:30,487 --> 00:05:33,227
Trying to remember the factions from Toru's world.

77
00:05:33,747 --> 00:05:35,807
Elulu's from the Chaos Faction, too, I think.

78
00:05:36,427 --> 00:05:39,407
They hate humans, and they raise their children with the same principles.

79
00:05:40,367 --> 00:05:41,587
Elulu grew up that way.

80
00:05:42,287 --> 00:05:43,607
It's the only truth she knows.

81
00:05:43,607 --> 00:05:47,227
She can't help the way she thinks.

82
00:05:51,787 --> 00:05:53,367
Good evening, Ms. Kobayashi.

83
00:05:53,527 --> 00:05:53,727
Huh?

84
00:05:54,007 --> 00:05:55,327
Kana's already asleep.

85
00:05:55,807 --> 00:05:56,787
What do you say?

86
00:05:56,987 --> 00:05:57,847
How about a nightcap?

87
00:05:57,847 --> 00:06:05,067
Good stuff.

88
00:06:05,227 --> 00:06:05,647
Yep.

89
00:06:06,267 --> 00:06:06,947
That's it.

90
00:06:07,227 --> 00:06:09,127
I'm done overthinking my anatomy today.

91
00:06:11,707 --> 00:06:12,607
What the?

92
00:06:12,967 --> 00:06:14,267
I recognize this feeling.

93
00:06:14,687 --> 00:06:15,427
The love potion?

94
00:06:18,087 --> 00:06:20,427
You thought I wouldn't notice it, didn't you?

95
00:06:20,427 --> 00:06:22,847
Oh, I know your scent very well.

96
00:06:23,207 --> 00:06:24,527
You have fully parts!

97
00:06:25,527 --> 00:06:27,467
This is Elulu's work, isn't it?

98
00:06:29,007 --> 00:06:30,547
I'm sorry, Ms. Kobayashi.

99
00:06:30,987 --> 00:06:32,687
I'll get you back to normal soon.

100
00:06:32,847 --> 00:06:34,147
But not just yet.

101
00:06:34,387 --> 00:06:36,167
I'm not going to throw away this opportunity.

102
00:06:37,027 --> 00:06:38,387
Our hearts have become intimate.

103
00:06:38,507 --> 00:06:39,747
Now we get out our bodies.

104
00:06:41,247 --> 00:06:42,647
Come on, Ms. Kobayashi.

105
00:06:43,447 --> 00:06:45,007
I'm ready to receive you now.

106
00:06:45,227 --> 00:06:47,067
Wait, are you completely turned off?

107
00:06:47,067 --> 00:06:48,187
Where's your maid outfit?

108
00:06:48,627 --> 00:06:49,427
You took it off?

109
00:06:50,427 --> 00:06:53,747
Toru, I'm going to tell you why maids are great,

110
00:06:54,047 --> 00:06:55,227
but with my man-brain.

111
00:07:00,187 --> 00:07:00,827
Finally.

112
00:07:05,387 --> 00:07:06,987
Now that that's over,

113
00:07:07,607 --> 00:07:09,807
what will you try to do next, Elulu?

114
00:07:09,807 --> 00:07:20,007
Very good job.

115
00:07:20,127 --> 00:07:21,687
It's displayed nicely, Miss.

116
00:07:21,807 --> 00:07:22,327
Hmm.

117
00:07:23,127 --> 00:07:25,307
Something's still not right about it.

118
00:07:27,787 --> 00:07:28,847
There we go.

119
00:07:29,227 --> 00:07:30,307
So wonderful.

120
00:07:30,307 --> 00:07:44,767
Slow down.

121
00:07:44,967 --> 00:07:45,687
Stop running.

122
00:07:49,687 --> 00:07:51,627
You followed me here, you harmony bastard!

123
00:07:51,627 --> 00:07:54,527
I am Kremina, a dragon slayer.

124
00:07:55,267 --> 00:07:58,187
Please give my name to the judge in the underworld after you die.

125
00:07:58,767 --> 00:07:59,907
I want all the credit.

126
00:08:03,027 --> 00:08:03,927
Where is she?

127
00:08:05,687 --> 00:08:08,507
Elulu always seems to appear when I'm alone after work.

128
00:08:08,507 --> 00:08:11,207
Maybe she'll show up if I wait here.

129
00:08:12,627 --> 00:08:14,007
But why would I do that?

130
00:08:14,727 --> 00:08:17,247
I might be focusing on Elulu a little too much.

131
00:08:18,127 --> 00:08:20,927
I wonder if it's because I feel like we could get along somehow.

132
00:08:20,927 --> 00:08:25,667
All the dragons I've met from other worlds have been friendly,

133
00:08:25,907 --> 00:08:27,127
so it makes sense.

134
00:08:28,047 --> 00:08:31,387
They all have this air of having survived conflict with humans,

135
00:08:31,527 --> 00:08:32,767
ending in tragic results.

136
00:08:33,227 --> 00:08:35,507
Yet they remain tolerant of people in general.

137
00:08:36,067 --> 00:08:38,047
They understand we're not all like that.

138
00:08:38,507 --> 00:08:41,507
They're willing to believe there's more to us than the trouble we cause.

139
00:08:42,507 --> 00:08:44,607
And that's how I feel about Toru too.

140
00:08:45,607 --> 00:08:48,607
Which is why it's important for her to reconcile with Elulu.

141
00:08:49,367 --> 00:08:50,047
Keep the peace.

142
00:08:50,927 --> 00:08:54,827
Of course she's not showing up.

143
00:08:55,907 --> 00:08:58,407
Maybe she went over here where there's less foot traffic.

144
00:09:05,647 --> 00:09:06,207
Elulu!

145
00:09:07,727 --> 00:09:08,767
Are you injured?

146
00:09:10,027 --> 00:09:11,467
You've seen us, have you?

147
00:09:12,467 --> 00:09:14,247
Greetings, human of this world.

148
00:09:14,727 --> 00:09:18,687
I've come here to destroy that vile beast before you from the Chaos Faction.

149
00:09:18,687 --> 00:09:24,547
You must leave this place immediately and forget everything you witnessed here tonight.

150
00:09:25,367 --> 00:09:26,787
Who is this jerk?

151
00:09:27,167 --> 00:09:28,987
You came all the way here to kill Elulu?

152
00:09:29,387 --> 00:09:31,907
So you're a grown adult here trying to kill a child?

153
00:09:32,107 --> 00:09:32,747
I am.

154
00:09:33,427 --> 00:09:35,647
That creature is pure chaos.

155
00:09:35,967 --> 00:09:38,667
An evil dragon that will bring harm to humans.

156
00:09:38,667 --> 00:09:40,667
Well, if that's the case, then...

157
00:09:42,107 --> 00:09:42,347
Huh?

158
00:09:45,347 --> 00:09:45,747
Ah!

159
00:09:46,527 --> 00:09:47,127
Oh.

160
00:09:47,587 --> 00:09:49,907
That is a most unpleasant sound.

161
00:09:50,067 --> 00:09:50,447
Hey!

162
00:09:50,627 --> 00:09:51,827
Keep it down out there!

163
00:09:51,847 --> 00:09:52,347
All right!

164
00:09:52,887 --> 00:09:54,827
Security buzzer power!

165
00:09:56,147 --> 00:10:01,587
How much do you weigh?

166
00:10:01,587 --> 00:10:04,167
It seems they've escaped.

167
00:10:05,067 --> 00:10:06,547
What's that human thinking?

168
00:10:11,207 --> 00:10:11,727
Hi.

169
00:10:11,987 --> 00:10:13,027
Can you see my face?

170
00:10:14,807 --> 00:10:15,987
How are you feeling?

171
00:10:16,567 --> 00:10:19,307
It looks like your wound healed up freakishly fast, at least.

172
00:10:20,307 --> 00:10:21,827
Why did you save me?

173
00:10:22,327 --> 00:10:24,367
Hard to tell if the coast is clear.

174
00:10:25,267 --> 00:10:27,307
I bet that creeper's still after you, huh?

175
00:10:27,967 --> 00:10:28,907
I don't know.

176
00:10:29,467 --> 00:10:29,767
Hmm?

177
00:10:31,427 --> 00:10:32,907
I shouldn't avoid battles.

178
00:10:33,087 --> 00:10:34,707
If I die, that means it was my fate.

179
00:10:35,347 --> 00:10:38,647
Well, if that's the case, then me wanting to save you would also be your fate.

180
00:10:42,367 --> 00:10:43,167
Hey, Elulu?

181
00:10:43,807 --> 00:10:45,607
Is there something else you want to tell me?

182
00:10:46,127 --> 00:10:49,307
You seem to have this constant toot, and it's making me a little concerned.

183
00:10:49,307 --> 00:10:53,867
I told you, I can't accept dragons coexisting with humans.

184
00:10:54,787 --> 00:10:57,287
It's not possible for them to ever get along.

185
00:10:57,927 --> 00:10:58,427
Oh, yeah.

186
00:10:58,527 --> 00:10:59,367
I remember that, kinda.

187
00:11:00,407 --> 00:11:02,307
Because if they can get along, then that means...

188
00:11:03,467 --> 00:11:07,007
That means I wasted so many years believing the lies!

189
00:11:10,407 --> 00:11:14,147
Dragons are superior, so to associate with humans is shameful.

190
00:11:14,687 --> 00:11:15,607
I just...

191
00:11:15,607 --> 00:11:17,807
They caused all kinds of tragedies.

192
00:11:17,807 --> 00:11:19,547
Harmony is now impossible.

193
00:11:20,067 --> 00:11:20,907
But I...

194
00:11:20,907 --> 00:11:22,347
Humans are our enemy.

195
00:11:22,847 --> 00:11:23,667
It's not fair.

196
00:11:24,187 --> 00:11:24,807
I just went...

197
00:11:28,607 --> 00:11:30,267
So badly!

198
00:11:32,267 --> 00:11:33,507
One more time!

199
00:11:33,927 --> 00:11:35,847
Please, just let me fight with them again!

200
00:11:40,947 --> 00:11:42,527
But they wouldn't let me.

201
00:11:42,947 --> 00:11:45,807
That girl and that boy did nothing bad to us, and yet...

202
00:11:45,807 --> 00:11:52,847
I'm so sorry.

203
00:11:53,747 --> 00:11:54,447
Don't listen.

204
00:11:57,187 --> 00:11:59,567
Why don't we all play together next time?

205
00:12:02,567 --> 00:12:04,747
We do all kinds of things you might like.

206
00:12:05,127 --> 00:12:08,967
We play dodgeball, go to kamiket, go to hot springs, lots of stuff.

207
00:12:08,967 --> 00:12:10,167
But...

208
00:12:10,167 --> 00:12:13,267
You'll have to chill out on the kind of play that turns into battles.

209
00:12:14,007 --> 00:12:14,407
You...

210
00:12:14,407 --> 00:12:15,887
You're trying to trick me!

211
00:12:16,407 --> 00:12:19,247
You're saying all these nice things to me to try and win me over!

212
00:12:19,787 --> 00:12:20,907
Yeah, I guess I am.

213
00:12:21,567 --> 00:12:27,127
You caught me trying to tame a fierce, evil chaos dragon with kindness and friendship so that I might render her harmless.

214
00:12:28,087 --> 00:12:30,047
You can still believe what you've been taught.

215
00:12:30,427 --> 00:12:31,927
Or would you like to be tricked by me?

216
00:12:31,927 --> 00:12:44,647
I would...

217
00:12:44,647 --> 00:12:45,327
That's enough.

218
00:12:45,327 --> 00:12:49,667
I can't believe you and that human were working together.

219
00:12:50,467 --> 00:12:51,867
I'll exterminate you both.

220
00:12:52,487 --> 00:12:53,507
Can you do that?

221
00:12:53,887 --> 00:12:54,987
Don't you have rules, too?

222
00:12:55,787 --> 00:12:57,987
Those rules only exist on paper.

223
00:12:58,667 --> 00:13:00,227
And they only apply to dragons.

224
00:13:00,707 --> 00:13:03,947
So if you think it's safe for you to corrupt our species, try it.

225
00:13:03,947 --> 00:13:07,927
This guy's making Toru's father seem like a baby garden gecko.

226
00:13:09,527 --> 00:13:10,167
But...

227
00:13:10,167 --> 00:13:14,227
Humans can be so much worse.

228
00:13:15,127 --> 00:13:17,547
A human who's trying to protect a dragon?

229
00:13:21,767 --> 00:13:22,367
Kobayashi!

230
00:13:24,107 --> 00:13:24,787
Ow!

231
00:13:29,267 --> 00:13:31,307
Okay, that would hurt for real.

232
00:13:31,307 --> 00:13:34,487
Well, look who's late.

233
00:13:49,207 --> 00:13:49,727
Impossible.

234
00:13:50,267 --> 00:13:51,387
How did you get here?

235
00:13:52,667 --> 00:13:54,587
You dare hurt Miss Kobayashi!

236
00:13:55,367 --> 00:13:56,707
I'm not threatened by you.

237
00:13:56,967 --> 00:13:58,707
I have reinforcements waiting to be summoned.

238
00:13:59,167 --> 00:14:00,447
Lady Emma will be here to...

239
00:14:00,447 --> 00:14:05,307
Choose your words wisely, you coward.

240
00:14:05,787 --> 00:14:08,727
Maybe if you beg, I'll let you keep your soul after I crush you.

241
00:14:09,287 --> 00:14:09,907
Go ahead.

242
00:14:10,307 --> 00:14:11,747
Beg for your worthless life.

243
00:14:12,447 --> 00:14:12,927
Ah!

244
00:14:12,927 --> 00:14:12,987
Ah!

245
00:14:12,987 --> 00:14:13,487
Ah!

246
00:14:13,487 --> 00:14:14,487
Ah!

247
00:14:14,487 --> 00:14:14,987
Ah!

248
00:14:14,987 --> 00:14:15,487
Ah!

249
00:14:15,487 --> 00:14:15,587
Ah!

250
00:14:15,587 --> 00:14:15,987
Ah!

251
00:14:16,987 --> 00:14:17,127
Ah!

252
00:14:17,127 --> 00:14:17,307
Ah!

253
00:14:21,627 --> 00:14:23,347
Um, did I witness murder?

254
00:14:23,347 --> 00:14:28,447
No, I just erased his memories of this world and then sent him back from whence he came.

255
00:14:28,447 --> 00:14:30,827
Um, but not before I punished him, of course.

256
00:14:31,307 --> 00:14:31,967
Of course.

257
00:14:33,307 --> 00:14:34,247
Thank goodness.

258
00:14:34,607 --> 00:14:35,887
Now a Lulu can chill.

259
00:14:37,007 --> 00:14:37,747
Oh, gross.

260
00:14:37,907 --> 00:14:40,047
Now that we're okay, I'm feeling...

261
00:14:40,047 --> 00:14:40,247
Ah!

262
00:14:40,907 --> 00:14:41,407
Ah!

263
00:14:41,567 --> 00:14:42,327
Miss Kobayashi!

264
00:14:43,007 --> 00:14:44,587
Don't worry, I'll help you out.

265
00:14:44,587 --> 00:14:50,387
Drugs and Slime can stop bleeding instantly by just making up excuses to liquor!

266
00:14:50,387 --> 00:14:52,087
Are you ready, Miss Kobayashi?

267
00:14:52,567 --> 00:14:53,647
Lick-lick-lick-lick-lick-lick-lick-lick-lick-lick-lick-lick-lick-lick-lick-lick-lick-lick.

268
00:14:53,647 --> 00:14:55,667
Your tongue is obscene, what you are.

269
00:14:55,667 --> 00:15:25,447
And that's when I met Toru.

270
00:15:25,667 --> 00:15:27,827
And when she managed to change me for the better.

271
00:15:29,107 --> 00:15:33,507
I wonder if maybe I was seeing my old self in Ilulu.

272
00:15:37,727 --> 00:15:38,887
Miss Kobayashi?

273
00:15:39,127 --> 00:15:40,307
You're finally awake!

274
00:15:40,467 --> 00:15:41,607
Everything will be alright.

275
00:15:41,987 --> 00:15:42,587
Toru?

276
00:15:43,307 --> 00:15:44,107
Hey there, Kana.

277
00:15:45,267 --> 00:15:46,487
Are we in our home?

278
00:15:46,747 --> 00:15:47,207
We are.

279
00:15:47,567 --> 00:15:49,647
I brought you back here and healed your wounds, too.

280
00:15:50,467 --> 00:15:51,887
Where did Ilulu go?

281
00:15:53,967 --> 00:15:55,167
She's right there.

282
00:15:55,667 --> 00:16:02,287
I tried to send her off, but she wouldn't leave your side.

283
00:16:02,627 --> 00:16:06,427
I'm glad she finally sees what we figured out ages ago, but it's just a little too late.

284
00:16:07,067 --> 00:16:07,627
Kobayashi!

285
00:16:08,127 --> 00:16:10,747
Will you please trick me?

286
00:16:14,047 --> 00:16:14,567
Sure.

287
00:16:15,107 --> 00:16:16,007
I'd love to.

288
00:16:16,007 --> 00:16:29,247
Good morning.

289
00:16:29,467 --> 00:16:32,847
El Niño Miki is here to bring you today's national weather.

290
00:16:33,707 --> 00:16:35,367
What do we do about that tail?

291
00:16:35,967 --> 00:16:37,567
I guess those claws don't retract.

292
00:16:38,047 --> 00:16:40,427
Is it possible to make her chest more family-friendly?

293
00:16:40,427 --> 00:16:41,327
I mean, come on.

294
00:16:41,927 --> 00:16:45,587
Believe it or not, Ilulu is already pushing herself to maintain a modest size.

295
00:16:46,227 --> 00:16:49,127
If she wasn't, I'm not so sure she'd be able to fit through the door.

296
00:16:49,687 --> 00:16:52,727
Oh, I bet she could hide her claws and tail somewhere if she tried.

297
00:16:52,847 --> 00:16:53,167
Wait!

298
00:16:53,387 --> 00:16:55,287
Since when can't she control body parts?

299
00:16:55,747 --> 00:16:57,787
All I need is about 5% of that.

300
00:16:59,047 --> 00:16:59,367
Kobayashi!

301
00:16:59,887 --> 00:17:00,207
Kobayashi!

302
00:17:00,467 --> 00:17:01,287
Hey, what's up?

303
00:17:01,807 --> 00:17:03,687
This is where we eliminate waste, right?

304
00:17:04,187 --> 00:17:05,167
How does it work?

305
00:17:05,427 --> 00:17:07,087
Uh, we're doing this?

306
00:17:07,767 --> 00:17:08,007
Yep.

307
00:17:08,387 --> 00:17:09,287
Hop on up there.

308
00:17:09,767 --> 00:17:10,907
And that's basically it.

309
00:17:11,227 --> 00:17:11,967
I got it.

310
00:17:12,887 --> 00:17:15,247
I guess we'll have to teach her all kinds of things.

311
00:17:17,327 --> 00:17:20,707
If only I had a talented maid to help me in times like these.

312
00:17:21,107 --> 00:17:22,967
I'd probably see them in a whole new light.

313
00:17:25,247 --> 00:17:26,627
I'm sorry about this.

314
00:17:26,627 --> 00:17:28,707
I promise it'll just be while I'm at work.

315
00:17:28,707 --> 00:17:30,547
Don't be silly, it's fine.

316
00:17:30,827 --> 00:17:33,947
It's what you do for someone when you have a special eternal bond with them.

317
00:17:34,087 --> 00:17:35,767
I'm not feeling ready to use the word eternal.

318
00:17:36,127 --> 00:17:36,767
Okay, bye!

319
00:17:38,147 --> 00:17:40,007
Have you been pumped with those muscles, Dad?

320
00:17:40,087 --> 00:17:41,667
When you stop working out, these stuff's crazy.

321
00:17:41,667 --> 00:17:42,427
It's weird.

322
00:17:44,587 --> 00:17:47,367
We were trying to kill each other just days ago.

323
00:17:48,027 --> 00:17:50,387
There's no way Toru would ever forgive a traitor.

324
00:17:50,987 --> 00:17:52,887
I know she's planning to eliminate me.

325
00:17:52,887 --> 00:17:55,127
But I want to spend more time with Kobayashi.

326
00:17:55,547 --> 00:17:57,387
And I'm not going down without a fight.

327
00:17:57,387 --> 00:17:59,507
There's no fighting.

328
00:18:02,927 --> 00:18:03,367
Here.

329
00:18:04,187 --> 00:18:07,127
This is the manual I wrote about how to live your life as a human.

330
00:18:07,587 --> 00:18:10,007
Rule number A, change your claws into hands.

331
00:18:10,007 --> 00:18:23,407
How is it funny to fail at the one task you're given?

332
00:18:23,727 --> 00:18:25,987
Do you suck at everything or just making hands?

333
00:18:26,207 --> 00:18:27,607
I can't transform them well.

334
00:18:28,107 --> 00:18:29,167
But I can still read.

335
00:18:29,547 --> 00:18:31,707
At least you can hold some stuff with those things.

336
00:18:31,827 --> 00:18:33,467
It's a ball of tiny hands, look!

337
00:18:33,687 --> 00:18:34,067
Ew!

338
00:18:34,407 --> 00:18:34,847
Gross!

339
00:18:34,847 --> 00:18:37,707
Greetings.

340
00:18:38,587 --> 00:18:41,007
Humans establish communication with greetings.

341
00:18:41,747 --> 00:18:44,427
For now, just repeat whatever greeting one says to you.

342
00:18:46,147 --> 00:18:46,627
Food.

343
00:18:47,267 --> 00:18:48,987
Humans will mostly eat anything.

344
00:18:49,367 --> 00:18:51,347
But they stubbornly won't eat dragon meat.

345
00:18:51,867 --> 00:18:54,427
Currently seeking ways to get them to change this.

346
00:18:55,387 --> 00:18:55,947
Mating.

347
00:18:55,947 --> 00:18:57,467
I want to do it.

348
00:18:57,767 --> 00:18:59,087
Everything in here is biased!

349
00:18:59,307 --> 00:19:01,087
It is the whole truth and nothing but.

350
00:19:01,527 --> 00:19:02,007
Clothing.

351
00:19:02,607 --> 00:19:06,667
Wearing clothing similar to what other humans wear will keep you from standing out.

352
00:19:08,847 --> 00:19:10,867
Doesn't look like you're trying to blend in.

353
00:19:11,447 --> 00:19:11,707
What?

354
00:19:12,187 --> 00:19:13,507
Bud, whatever you say.

355
00:19:13,847 --> 00:19:15,747
I can wear human clothes if we're supposed to.

356
00:19:16,467 --> 00:19:17,887
We don't have your size here.

357
00:19:17,927 --> 00:19:19,007
What about Kana's stuff?

358
00:19:19,067 --> 00:19:20,107
She's even smaller!

359
00:19:21,067 --> 00:19:21,507
Look!

360
00:19:21,567 --> 00:19:22,187
It fits!

361
00:19:24,567 --> 00:19:26,087
See, what did I tell you?

362
00:19:26,427 --> 00:19:29,887
Quit making things complicated and transform your scales the way I do.

363
00:19:30,087 --> 00:19:31,887
I don't have the skills to do it, okay?

364
00:19:32,607 --> 00:19:33,487
Sad for you.

365
00:19:33,607 --> 00:19:35,147
But I can lend you something of mine.

366
00:19:36,107 --> 00:19:38,167
So, what do you plan to contribute here?

367
00:19:38,907 --> 00:19:40,087
I haven't thought about it.

368
00:19:40,447 --> 00:19:41,627
Well, what are you good at?

369
00:19:41,627 --> 00:19:43,107
There has to be something, right?

370
00:19:43,967 --> 00:19:45,427
Yeah, I'm sure there is.

371
00:19:46,747 --> 00:19:47,527
I'm thinking.

372
00:19:48,367 --> 00:19:49,187
Are you, though?

373
00:19:49,627 --> 00:19:49,987
Mm-hmm.

374
00:19:51,227 --> 00:19:55,327
Well, you are welcome to stay in our home as long as you would like until you make a decision.

375
00:19:55,347 --> 00:19:56,727
Can you say it without twitching?

376
00:19:57,367 --> 00:20:03,007
I know this may come as a surprise to you, Mushroom Mitz, but I'm not particularly thrilled to have you here as a house guest.

377
00:20:03,127 --> 00:20:04,067
Not surprised at all.

378
00:20:04,307 --> 00:20:06,887
Think about that humiliating grand entrance you made.

379
00:20:07,047 --> 00:20:09,527
We thought you were some crazy, bloodthirsty berserker.

380
00:20:09,987 --> 00:20:10,387
Whatever.

381
00:20:10,387 --> 00:20:12,827
I was bored and fighting you seemed like fun.

382
00:20:12,927 --> 00:20:14,747
Are you trying to say that's what I look like?

383
00:20:15,747 --> 00:20:18,607
All I know is you better figure out what you want your job to be.

384
00:20:18,987 --> 00:20:21,507
There's a saying that goes, those who don't work don't eat.

385
00:20:21,967 --> 00:20:22,847
What about Kana?

386
00:20:23,367 --> 00:20:24,187
Kana can't work.

387
00:20:24,247 --> 00:20:25,507
She's an elementary school student.

388
00:20:25,927 --> 00:20:26,907
Okay, then fine.

389
00:20:26,987 --> 00:20:28,807
I'll be an elementary school student, too.

390
00:20:29,087 --> 00:20:31,087
You have to be a child to go to school, dummy.

391
00:20:31,087 --> 00:20:33,847
And I'm guessing you're about the same age as me, aren't you?

392
00:20:34,567 --> 00:20:35,007
Maybe.

393
00:20:39,587 --> 00:20:41,147
Hurry up and make a choice.

394
00:20:42,347 --> 00:20:43,427
I'm back!

395
00:20:43,727 --> 00:20:44,727
Welcome home!

396
00:20:45,427 --> 00:20:46,687
What's going on with you, Lulu?

397
00:20:47,327 --> 00:20:50,007
She's thinking about how she wants to contribute around here.

398
00:20:50,787 --> 00:20:51,187
Hmm.

399
00:20:54,387 --> 00:20:55,987
Whatever you choose will be great.

400
00:20:55,987 --> 00:20:58,947
What's wrong?

401
00:20:59,527 --> 00:21:01,487
I figured out what I want to do while I'm here.

402
00:21:02,287 --> 00:21:03,027
Okay, cool.

403
00:21:03,087 --> 00:21:03,527
What is it?

404
00:21:03,947 --> 00:21:05,507
I want to make babies with you.

405
00:21:05,947 --> 00:21:06,087
Huh?

406
00:21:06,887 --> 00:21:11,567
You see, I thought about it and I'm at the perfect age to reproduce and raise healthy children.

407
00:21:12,347 --> 00:21:15,987
I'm very lonely from not having a family and I think you're the one to rescue me.

408
00:21:16,687 --> 00:21:18,607
Kobayashi, I want you to mate with me.

409
00:21:18,667 --> 00:21:19,627
You want it?

410
00:21:19,627 --> 00:21:23,547
I don't know what you're trying to pull, ma'am, but you've crossed over the light and back!

411
00:21:23,647 --> 00:21:24,807
Also, we're both female.

412
00:21:25,147 --> 00:21:26,407
I can give your thing back.

413
00:21:26,467 --> 00:21:28,727
Don't you dare unless you want her to use it on me!

414
00:21:29,587 --> 00:21:29,987
Pervert.

415
00:21:30,667 --> 00:21:31,107
Yep.

416
00:21:31,367 --> 00:21:32,307
I mean it!

417
00:21:32,407 --> 00:21:36,047
I'm not trying to hold on to my purity, but I'm also not trying to get with dragons.

418
00:21:42,507 --> 00:21:42,947
Surprise!

419
00:21:43,807 --> 00:21:45,007
I thought you might like it.

420
00:21:45,007 --> 00:21:47,187
Ahaha!

421
00:21:51,887 --> 00:21:52,787
Bye!

422
00:23:19,937 --> 00:23:25,157
Where are you going to sleep, you Lulu?

423
00:23:25,397 --> 00:23:26,857
We don't have space for another bed.

424
00:23:27,317 --> 00:23:28,257
What about in here?

425
00:23:28,397 --> 00:23:28,937
The closet?

426
00:23:29,237 --> 00:23:30,357
It's calming.

427
00:23:30,697 --> 00:23:32,177
I mean, if you're okay with it, sure.

428
00:23:32,257 --> 00:23:33,697
Yeah, I like it.

429
00:23:36,757 --> 00:23:39,317
This week on Who's Rotten?

430
00:23:39,677 --> 00:23:40,117
Cancer!

